OL,3,GNEWSAVillage vows 'belt and braces'
OL,4,Aplan after heath fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village said it would take a "belt
OL,7,Fand braces" approach to better
OL,8,Fequipping itself to deal with natural
OL,9,Fdisasters after the devastating
OL,10,Fwildfire at Dunwich Heath.
OL,12,FParts of the National Trust heathland
OL,13,Fand neighbouring RSPB Minsmere on the
OL,14,FSuffolk coast caught fire on 29 July,
OL,15,Fwith the inferno eventually ripping
OL,16,Fthrough an area the size of 210
OL,17,Ffootball pitches.
OL,19,FAt the peak of the blaze, which Suffolk
OL,20,FFire Service did not call a stop on
OL,21,Funtil 21 August, some 120 firefighters
OL,22,Fwere at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
